#!/bin/bash
# Download all data and models needed for this environment.
#
# Idempotent; safe to run multiple times.
#
# Estimated total download size: 0 GB
# Estimated disk usage after extraction: 0 GB
#
# Nothing is fetched from external sources: the benchmark uses no public datasets or
# pretrained weights. Its public data are small agent-generated files tracked in git:
#   data/three_spin_binary/  (train.csv, dev.csv)
#   data/double_exchange/    (energies as CSV; spin configurations regenerate from the
